# Force LF in the working tree on every OS so line endings are deterministic — critical for
# generated files (JSON Schema), golden fixtures, and any byte-exact comparison. Without this
# git's autocrlf checks out CRLF on Windows and breaks drift/snapshot checks.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types (none yet, but future-proofed) should never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
